@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Operate the list by touch
actor "Application user" as user
box "Frontend - Package" #E0F2FE
  participant "Combobox<T>" as cb
end box
box "Frontend - Browser/CDK" #E0F2FE
  participant "Touch events / outside-pointer stream" as browser
end box


user -> browser : Tap option
browser -> cb : Compatibility mousedown prevented; click calls toggle
cb -> cb : Update value once; synchronously focus input (L2-040)
cb --> user : Popup stays open; selected checkmark updates
note over cb, browser
  Native touch pointerdown is not cancelled; drag scrolling remains available.
  Real on-screen keyboard retention remains a manual release check.
end note
user -> cb : Tap remove, clear-all or toggle
cb -> cb : Apply removal destination, input focus or toggle policy
cb --> user : CSS target meets 24 by 24 px minimum (L2-039)
user -> browser : Tap outside
browser -> cb : OverlayRef.outsidePointerEvents
cb -> cb : Close when target is also outside host
@enduml
